      Plexus Division of BancTec Expands Support of Imaging and
   Workflow Products for the Enterprise on Digital Alpha Platform


Sunnyvale, Calif., -- August 22, 1996 -- Plexus Division of BancTec, 
Inc., and Digital Equipment Corporation today announced a major 
expansion of support for Plexus' enterprise-scale Imaging and 
Workflow products on Digital's AlphaServer system family, including 
full support of the NT platform. 

A comprehensive technology partnership between the companies will 
result in the introduction of a Windows NT-based implementation of 
Plexus' leading enterprise-class imaging and workflow products for 
the increasingly popular Digital AlphaServer family of systems. 
Digital's AlphaServer family is the industry's only complete line of 
tested, proven and mature high-performance 64-bit RISC servers. 

Plexus' family of products provide customers with powerful, scalable 
imaging and workflow solutions for their enterprise needs. A full 
complement of Plexus enterprise products will be offered on the 
Alpha/NT platform, including the ObjectServer, StorageManager and 
FloWare with Oracle products.  

As a further part of the agreement, Plexus will continue to broaden 
support of its products already available on Digital UNIX to 
encompass the expanding Digital UNIX product line.

As part of this agreement Plexus will develop and support the 
software, and train its customer services and professional services 
organizations to implement and support Plexus products on the 
Alpha/NT platform. Plexus will designate Alpha/NT as its 
enterprise-scale NT reference platform for its server products, and 
both companies will cooperate to jointly promote the combined 
products through their marketing channels.

Mr. John A. Torkelson, Vice President and General Manager of Plexus 
commented, "The market continues to search out effective enterprise 
solutions for imaging and workflow and NT has now emerged as one of 
the areas of major customer interest. Plexus has long demonstrated 
its leadership in providing open system enterprise solutions to the 
world's leading companies. We believe that the combination of NT and 
the power and reliability of the Digital Alpha computers, coupled 
with the proven Plexus products, will allow us to maintain that 
leadership position by offering an important new strategic 
alternative for our customers."

"We are pleased to extend our relationship with Plexus, a supplier 
of leading-edge imaging and workflow software," said Lucia Quinn, 
Digital's vice president of Strategic Marketing and Branding. 
"Digital has structured the most comprehensive Strategic Alliance in 
the industry with Microsoft. This alliance has played a paramount 
role in positioning Digital as an organization that proactively 
addresses the evolving needs of the imaging and workflow marketplace 
as it moves increasingly towards NT-based solutions."

Tim Yeaton, Director of Commercial UNIX Products Group, Digital 
added, "The coupling of Plexus' suite of imaging and workflow 
software with Digital 64-bit UNIX has been, and continues to be, a 
winning combination that provides customers with robust performance 
and availability for enterprise applications." 

Plexus Background:

Headquartered in Sunnyvale, California, the Plexus Software Division 
of BancTec is a leading supplier of client-server based imaging and 
workflow software for automating large scale, mission-critical, 
paper and data-intensive business processes.  With over 1,000 sites 
the Plexus Software Division has the largest installed base of 
open-imaging and workflow software in the world.  Plexus software is 
used in applications such as insurance, medical records and claims 
processing, banking, customer services, records management, new 
application processing, accounts receivable/payable processing, 
mortgage, mutual funds, and government applications.  

BancTec Background:

BancTec is a worldwide systems integration and services company 
specializing in automated applications for the banking, financial 
services, insurance, health care, government, utility, 
telecommunications, grocery and retail industries.  BancTec is also 
a leading provider of document workflow and imaging products, as 
well as network support services for local area networks and 
personal computers. In addition, BancTec manufactures document 
processing equipment for OEM customers.

Digital Background:

Digital Equipment Corporation is the world's leader in open 
client/server solutions from personal computing to integrated 
